          "text": "KU Ying-t'ai 谷應泰 (T. 賡虞, H. 霖蒼, d. after 1689), scholar and official, was a native of Fêng-jun, Chihli. After becoming a chin-shih in 1647, he was for a time an assistant secretary in the Board of Revenue.",
